    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>基准结果：故障结论分布 · rubric 与 judge 门限（项目实证数据）</Text>
